id=bt-arsenal-c2s
name=NetHunter Internal Bluetooth Mode Switch
version=0.1
versionCode=1
author=Luka Gejak
description=Switches the internal BCM4375B1 Bluetooth between Android's userspace stack and the kernel HCI line discipline, so BlueZ tools and Bluetooth Arsenal get a real hci0. Requires a kernel with the restored HCI socket layer.
